# SafeLink validation tests

This directory contains selected laboratory tests used during SafeLink development and hardware validation.

The tests are published as reproducibility and engineering evidence. Some tests predate the final Arduino-ESP32 3.3.7 / ESP-Hosted 2.11.6 P4 port released as SafeLink v0.1.0; each test directory documents its scope and provenance.

Selected tests are intentionally published rather than the entire development lab archive.
